B.a1D=s(["Spindle-shaped or diamond-shaped spots with gray centers and reddish-brown margins","Lesions enlarge and coalesce, causing entire leaf to wither","Neck rot causing panicle to fall over (blank panicles)"],t.s)
B.Zc=s(["Spray Tricyclazole 75% WP @ 0.6 g/liter of water immediately","Spray Isoprothiolane 40% EC @ 1.5 ml/liter","Avoid standing water logging in affected field areas","Do not apply top-dress Nitrogen fertilizer during outbreak"],t.s)
